│ patch_type               │ full                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ conflict_vnd_beam                                                                         │
│ patch_description        │ This redesign uses a staged conflict-aware search pipeline:                               │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ 1. Exact permutation enumeration is used for workloads with up to nine transactions,      │
│                          │ guaranteeing the optimal makespan for small instances.                                    │
│                          │ 2. Larger workloads use a wider mask-based beam search. Each prefix is ranked using       │
│                          │ `get_opt_seq_cost`, so choices are based directly on the simulator’s real conflict        │
│                          │ makespan.                                                                                 │
│                          │ 3. The strongest completed beam schedules are refined by variable-neighborhood descent:   │
│                          │    - single transaction insertion,                                                        │
│                          │    - transaction exchange,                                                                │
│                          │    - interval reversal,                                                                   │
│                          │    - contiguous block relocation.                                                         │
│                          │ 4. Block relocation is attempted only after simpler neighborhoods are exhausted. This     │
│                          │ allows the optimizer to cross local minima where two or three cooperating transactions    │
│                          │ must move together.                                                                       │
│                          │ 5. Cached schedule evaluations avoid recomputing simulator costs for repeated candidates. │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The design separates construction, evaluation, neighborhood generation, and refinement,   │
│                          │ making it easier to extend while searching substantially more meaningful conflict-order   │
│                          │ alternatives than a greedy scheduler.                                                     │
