├──────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ iterated_local_perturbation                                                               │
│ patch_description        │ Add a deterministic iterated-local-search phase after the existing beam-seeded descent.   │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The current code performs strong strict-improvement local search, but once every beam     │
│                          │ seed reaches an insertion/swap/reversal local optimum it cannot cross a makespan barrier  │
│                          │ requiring one temporary non-improving move. Transaction conflict landscapes commonly have │
│                          │ these barriers: a group of mutually conflicting transactions may need to be reordered     │
│                          │ together before any individual move reduces the critical-path delay.                      │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ This edit generates several deterministic, structurally different perturbations of the    │
│                          │ best schedule, including interval reversals, distant exchanges, and short block           │
│                          │ relocations. Each perturbed schedule is then reoptimized using the same actual simulator  │
│                          │ makespan objective and the same insertion/swap/reversal neighborhoods. The schedule is    │
│                          │ replaced only if the complete reoptimization produces a strictly better makespan,         │
│                          │ preserving validity and never sacrificing an already-found solution.                      │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The phase is bounded to avoid excessive simulator calls while allowing the search to      │
│                          │ escape local optima that the ordinary descent cannot improve directly.                    │
│ num_applied              │ 1                                                                                         │
│ api_costs                │ $0.0282                                                                                   │
