│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ adaptive_beam_width                                                                       │
│ patch_description        │ Use a two-stage beam search that preserves substantially more partial schedules during    │
│                          │ the early half of construction, where transaction ordering choices create the major       │
│                          │ conflict-dependency structure.                                                            │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ 1. Prefix makespan is not a reliable final-ranking signal early in the schedule: a        │
│                          │ slightly worse prefix can enable substantially more overlap once its remaining            │
│                          │ conflicting transactions are placed.                                                      │
│                          │ 2. The previous fixed 48-state beam prunes these alternatives too aggressively from the   │
│                          │ first depth onward.                                                                       │
│                          │ 3. Retaining up to 96 diverse conflict-aware prefixes in the first half allows the        │
│                          │ subsequent full-order evaluation and local insertion/swap improvement to start from       │
│                          │ stronger schedules.                                                                       │
│                          │ 4. The beam narrows back to the existing 48-state cap in the later half, where the prefix │
│                          │ is already constrained and additional states have less opportunity to diverge. This       │
│                          │ controls the number of expensive complete candidates and local-search seeds.              │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ All ranking remains based on `get_opt_seq_cost`, so the wider early search is guided      │
│                          │ directly by actual simulated makespan rather than operation-count heuristics.             │
│ num_applied              │ 2                                                                                         │
│ api_costs                │ $0.0260                                                                                   │
